97
00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:52.854
♪ But I lost my own track ♪

98
00:05:52.954 --> 00:06:01.028
♪ I'm too far gone to find
my way back ♪

99
00:06:01.128 --> 00:06:04.364
♪ Now I'm too far gone ♪

100
00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:09.604
